        "heading": "Test a difficult exception",
        "body": "Create a scenario in which two approved sources disagree during provider exit and data return. Ask what each source proves, what remains uncertain, which action is reversible, and who has authority over the consequence. The assistant should not choose the tidier answer merely to keep the queue moving. A useful exception record includes the item identifier, source links, exact discrepancy, deadline, action already taken, affected customer or process, and one answerable question. This gives the owner enough context to decide without reconstructing the full history. After the decision, update the instruction if the case is likely to recur. Keep the old evidence when audit or continuity needs it; do not rely on one person remembering a private chat."
